# Optional fine-grained GitHub PAT for host-side release helpers.
# Copy to token.local (gitignored). Never bake into the APK.
#
# Beauty Mirror has NO in-app OTA (privacy: no INTERNET permission).
# Distribution is GitHub Releases only.
#
# Default `make ship-release` uses ambient `gh` auth.
# To force this file: BM_USE_OTA_TOKEN=1 make ship-release
#
# Required for that override: Contents → Read and write (includes Releases)
# on alhussein-jamil/Beauty-Mirror
GITHUB_TOKEN_HERE
